# Discord community

## This repo owns

- **Community server ops:** `scripts/discord/` (setup, AutoMod, webhook tests)
- **Config SoT:** `src/data/discord.ts` — invite URL, channel slugs, webhook env key names
- **Marketing surfaces:** Discord CTAs, invite link in `site.ts` (sourced from `discord.ts`)

## Game monorepo owns

- **Runtime world-event POSTs:** `../Breachwalker/backend/functions/src/shared/notifications.ts`
- **Event hooks:** runs, marketplace callables
- **Player opt-out:** `notifications.broadcast_enabled` (when implemented)

## Webhook env naming

Prefer `DISCORD_WHISPERS_WEBHOOK` / `DISCORD_MARKETPLACE_WEBHOOK`. Functions also accept legacy `WORLD_EVENTS_*` — do not duplicate both names in Firebase secrets.

## Secrets

Never commit `.env` with `DISCORD_BOT_TOKEN` or webhook URLs. Never add tokens to Cloudflare Pages env (static site only).

## Copy rules for embeds

Rift Whispers and Marketplace posts use breach + rift vocabulary and `handle#tag` — see skill `breachwalker-terminology` and doc 07 §4.13.

## Agent workflow

Run skill `breachwalker-discord-ops` before editing server structure or webhook wiring.
